s\nAcademia\nEspaço gourmet\nPlayground\nPortaria remota 24h\nZelador\nBox para recebimento de entregas\n\nLocalização Estratégica no Bigorrilho\nUm imóvel ideal para famílias que valorizam espaço, funcionalidade e uma localização consolidada, com fácil acesso a escolas, hospitais, comércio e principais vias da cidade.\n\nAgenda agora a sua visita!","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ace7d1f4228b397cf2270a7/pilar-homes-images-watermark/331f08d5-639f-47b4-9e26-854e7b67366c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ace7d1f4228b397cf2270a7/pilar-homes-images-watermark/d3b6d7d4-a29b-41ef-bca5-78a010e1f508.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ace7d1f4228b397cf2270a7/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9e0023ea-d51f-471f-8454-c81066afc009.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ace7d1f4228b397cf2270a7/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8e07f8de-c9d5-4926-a55b-20a8c0aa38b1.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ace7d1f4228b397cf2270a7/pilar-homes-images-watermark/85da7b76-98b8-43f3-abab-1300dce07858.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ace7d1f4228b397cf2270a7/pilar-homes-images-watermark/1e0f0da3-3ec8-4495-921d-54b4b9cbdb2e.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ace7d1f4228b397cf2270a7/pilar-homes-images-watermark/fac96e9b-e432-4a5f-bb2d-91b30f789f59.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ace7d1f4228b397cf2270a7/pilar-homes-images-watermark/81fd15ba-ecec-4888-93a6-fdde0474ffcb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ace7d1f4228b397cf2270a7/pilar-homes-images-watermark/82c3d6b1-1356-46db-987f-9e2bdca8d700.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ace7d1f4228b397cf2270a7/pilar-homes-images-watermark/381c81f6-7a7c-4910-ae66-5a5bbfe5b622.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ace7d1f4228b397cf2270a7/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2a078633-4e3c-477b-88bc-3a890b06a3c0.jpeg",